hey guys I'm Angie Greenup from love  food and money and today's one minute  monday is make lists here are the  reasons I love making lists and you  should too they motivate you when you  see everything that you need to do right  in front of your face it likes that fire  under your butt to get things done it's  great for time management and  productivity you can really get a sense  of what's important and what's less  important if you put everything down on  a sheet of paper or however you make  your list and you can see it right in  front of you and start to manage your  time on what to do first what to do  second etc etc another reason you should  make list is because it keeps you from  getting overwhelmed there are a lot of  times when I think of something I need  to do and I just get overwhelmed that  it's yet another thing that I have to do  and oh my gosh it I have so much to do  that I can't even focus on what it is  that I have to do if i write it down and  put it in a list form it's so much less  overwhelming i can see it right in front  of me everything i have to do every day  i put in a list another reason to make  list is that it gives you a real sense  of accomplishment when you go to cross  something off nothing feels better than  to take out a sharpie and find something  on your to-do list you just finished  film a video for Evan Carmichael and  cross it off that feels amazing I just  like it's cathartic and I recommend  using a physical notepad to do list not  having your to-do list be on your phone  or on your computer because it'll sit  here on your desk all day it's always  there for you to reference you don't  have to open anything up you don't have  to scroll through your apps to find it  it's always here deleting something off  of your to-do list app does not feel as  good as crossing it off with a sharpie I  guarantee it so those are the reasons i  love using to-do lists and you should  use them to please subscribe to my  channel love food money and of course  subscribe to Evans channel because he's  awesome and most importantly don't  forget believe  make sure to check out my nose letter  yeah got 11 hi I'm Jason j-rod fonseka  of ra's online com and i want to say  Evan Carmichael's newsletter is  consistent fun inspiring XD only  newsletter I prioritize and look forward  to period
 

